Chute is open-core. This file is the MIT licence, and it does NOT cover the whole
repository — read the scope below before assuming it does.

  MIT (this file applies):
    Sources/chute/         the `chute` CLI
    Sources/ChuteCore/     the library the CLI is built from
    Sources/chutetests/    its test suite
    Scripts/               build, install and release scripts
    demo/, site/, worker/, marketing/, docs/, brand/, packaging/

  NOT MIT — all rights reserved (see the LICENSE file in each directory):
    Sources/ChuteApp/      the menu-bar app
    Sources/ChuteFinder/   the Finder right-click extension
    Resources/             that app's Info.plists, entitlements and assets

The paid product is the Finder menu and the menu-bar session switcher. Their source
is published so it can be read and audited, not so it can be redistributed. The CLI
is MIT and stays MIT — see README.md.

